{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong> is a fun and interactive desktop toybox filled with quirky virtual fidgets. It\u2019s designed to sit alongside your everyday workflow or gaming session, turning your desktop into a space where creativity meets playful distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1757909922\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1757909922\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1757909922\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1757909922\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fidgets aren't just for show, they <strong>react to you</strong>. <strong>Blow into your mic</strong> to inflate a virtual bag, or <strong>connect your camera</strong> to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1757909922\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1757909922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1757909922\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resize, move, and arrange</strong> your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla